        Called **before** the PI scan command is sent.
        The counter must be ready to start accumulating the instant the
        first trigger pulse arrives from the PI E-710.

        Parameters
        ----------
        n_pixels : int
            Total number of pixels.
            1D scan: n_x.
            2D scan: n_x × n_y  (all lines combined).
        t_pixel  : float
            Nominal dwell time per pixel in **seconds** (= 1 / frequency).
            Used to set the counter sample clock rate.

